119	// FetchTmpRefPrefix is the namespace for temporary refs used by fetch helpers
120	// to land a fetched hash before safely promoting it to a final ref (via
121	// PromoteTmpRefSafely). Prefer using the named constants below when possible.
122	const FetchTmpRefPrefix = "refs/entire-fetch-tmp/"
